<title>USA: MAPCO completes coal sale to Beacon Group.</title>
<headline>MAPCO completes coal sale to Beacon Group.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Okla. 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>MAPCO Inc said Tuesday it completed the sale of its coal business to The Beacon Group Energy Investment Fund L.P.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The Beacon Group Energy Investment Fund LP is managed by The Beacon Group, a private investment firm in New York. It also manages The Beacon Group III-Focus Value Fund L.P.</p>
<p>For the six months ended June 30, MAPCO's coal assets generated revenue of $237 million and net income of $14.3 million.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk, 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
